  "title": "Burnie A NDE 205",
  "date": "JANUARY 1992",
  "content": "When I was unconscious I felt like I was watching a play, I was traveling to different places, some fields, riverbeds, and my home. I saw myself as an older teenager and I saw a few other people that I had never met as if I was watching them on TV. I saw things happening to them that were not good. When I saw myself I was in a field with some guy (at the time I had no idea who he was) I saw him try to force himself on me, I also saw a gun and a few other blurry people hanging around. A few years later, I went to a party with some friends that was just outside the city limits. When it started to get dark I started to have incredible flash backs to what I saw when I was under, I decided to disappear because too many things seemed too familiar. The next day I found out that one of my friends was raped at gun point by someone who looked just like the guy I saw in my vision. The other people I saw in vision were mostly women getting hurt in some way, a couple of just bodies and people walking away from them. Over the next six or seven years most of the visions I saw came true, to some of the people that I knew and some were reported on TV and I had no idea who they were at all. Since then I still occasionally get visions when I'm asleep or just zoned out in class, of things happening to people who I don't know, which I see in the news or something just a little while later. It's kind of creepy; I wish I knew if I could use this to help some of these people before the pain.",
